WEBVTT

00:01.918 --> 00:03.294
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:03.378 --> 00:05.171
Kids: Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：是的，是的，队长。

00:05.255 --> 00:06.840
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.923 --> 00:08.883
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.967 --> 00:11.469
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.553 --> 00:13.596
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.680 --> 00:15.598
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.682 --> 00:17.350
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and
yellow and porous is he ♪
船长：♪ 吸水性强
黄色多孔就是他♪

00:17.434 --> 00:19.269
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.352 --> 00:21.479
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.563 --> 00:23.273
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.356 --> 00:25.525
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.608 --> 00:27.360
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:27.444 --> 00:29.362
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.446 --> 00:31.406
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.489 --> 00:33.533
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.616 --> 00:37.036
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:58.475 --> 01:00.226
Ahoy, Mr. Krabs.
嘿，蟹老板。

01:00.310 --> 01:01.269
Huh?
啊？

01:01.352 --> 01:03.938
Oh, ahoy, SpongeBob.
哦，嘿，海绵宝宝。

01:04.022 --> 01:06.149
Ahoy, Mr. Krabs.
嘿，蟹老板。

01:06.232 --> 01:08.067
OK, that's over with.
好了，就这样结束了。

01:08.151 --> 01:10.612
Now why don't you go see
if first mate Squidward
现在你为什么不去看看
如果大副章鱼哥

01:10.695 --> 01:12.280
needs any help
at the register.
需要任何帮助
在登记处。

01:13.907 --> 01:17.410
And what are you up to
on this fine, fine Monday?
你在做什么
周一好吗？

01:17.494 --> 01:19.579
Well, I was gonna
wait till this afternoon
嗯，我本来打算
等到今天下午

01:19.662 --> 01:22.040
but I guess I can show you now.
但我想我现在可以告诉你了。

01:22.123 --> 01:23.500
Show me what?
给我看看什么？

01:23.583 --> 01:25.293
I'm introducing a new
Krusty Krab promotion.
我要介绍一个新的
蟹堡王促销。

01:25.376 --> 01:26.920
Ah, you are?
啊，你是吗？

01:27.003 --> 01:28.713
I sure am.
我当然是。

01:28.797 --> 01:31.049
Who are you gonna
introduce it to?
你要是谁
介绍给?

01:31.132 --> 01:33.718
Why, all my loyal
customers, of course.
为什么，我所有的忠诚
当然是客户。

01:33.802 --> 01:35.261
Ha.
哈。

01:35.345 --> 01:38.807
Anyway, we got
new beverage cups.
无论如何，我们得到了
新的饮料杯。

01:38.890 --> 01:39.933
Wow.
哇。

01:40.016 --> 01:42.101
There's regular, large
有正规的，大的

01:42.185 --> 01:44.562
and the new Viking size.
和新的维京尺寸。

01:44.646 --> 01:47.398
But Mr. Krabs, these are
all the same size cup.
但是蟹老板，这些是
所有杯子尺寸相同。

01:47.482 --> 01:51.653
SpongeBob, this promotion
is designed to save  us  money.
海绵宝宝，这次促销
旨在为我们省钱。

01:51.736 --> 01:53.947
And don't forget, each
participating patron
并且不要忘记，每个
参与赞助人

01:54.030 --> 01:56.950
who purchases any drink
of our new Krusty Krab
Viking size cup
谁购买任何饮料
我们新推出的蟹堡王
维京尺寸的杯子

01:57.033 --> 01:59.744
gets a chance to
try on this genuine
cardboard Viking helmet.
有机会
试试这个正品
纸板维京头盔。

01:59.828 --> 02:02.789
That he found while cleaning out
his attic over the weekend.
他在打扫卫生时发现的
周末他的阁楼。

02:02.872 --> 02:05.416
Don't you know when
you're being ignored?
你不知道什么时候
你被忽视了？

02:05.500 --> 02:07.126
You're the only one talking.
你是唯一一个说话的人。

02:07.210 --> 02:09.087
Mr. Krabs, it's beautiful.
蟹老板，真漂亮。

02:09.170 --> 02:10.880
Not so fast.
没那么快。

02:10.964 --> 02:13.007
Access to the mighty helmet
will be granted
获得强大的头盔
将被授予

02:13.091 --> 02:16.469
to active promotion
participants only.
积极推广
仅限参与者。

02:16.553 --> 02:19.305
And only those who
purchase Viking size.
并且只有那些
购买维京尺寸。

02:19.389 --> 02:22.642
Mr. Krabs, what's a Viking?
蟹老板，什么是维京人？

02:23.309 --> 02:27.355
Oh, well, um...
The Vikings lived
a long time ago.
哦，好吧，嗯...
维京人曾居住过
很久以前。

02:27.438 --> 02:28.982
How long?
多长时间？

02:29.065 --> 02:31.025
Uh, about 10 years.
呃，大约10年。

02:31.109 --> 02:32.735
And?
和？

02:32.819 --> 02:36.030
You're gonna have
to ask Squidward any
more questions you got.
你将会有
向章鱼哥询问任何
您还有更多问题。

02:36.114 --> 02:37.240
He's the smart one.
他是最聪明的一个。

02:38.449 --> 02:40.159
Barnacle butt.
藤壶屁股。

02:40.243 --> 02:42.161
Hi, Squidward.
嗨，章鱼哥。

02:42.245 --> 02:44.122
Mr. Krabs said you
were gonna teach me
all about the Vikings.
蟹老板说你
我们要教我
关于维京人的一切。

02:44.205 --> 02:45.248
Oh, really?
哦真的吗？

02:45.331 --> 02:46.749
Will you teach me, huh?
你会教我吗？

02:46.833 --> 02:49.878
Sure, I'll teach you,
listen closely now.
当然可以，我来教你
现在仔细听。

02:49.961 --> 02:52.672
...The Vikings were a race
of scholars and scientists
...维京人是一个种族
学者和科学家的

02:52.755 --> 02:56.634
who lived before even
Mr. Krabs was born.
谁甚至以前生活过
蟹老板诞生了。

02:56.718 --> 02:59.053
They are believed to have
discovered ketchup
他们被认为有
发现番茄酱

02:59.137 --> 03:03.683
and enjoyed dressing up
their pets as chunks of masonry
on the weekends.
并喜欢打扮
他们的宠物就像砖石块一样
在周末。

03:03.766 --> 03:06.853
Their favorite movies
are in black and white.
他们最喜欢的电影
是黑白的。

03:06.936 --> 03:08.187
Look out!
当心！

03:08.271 --> 03:10.690
And grown Vikings are known
to collect socks
众所周知，成年维京人
收集袜子

03:10.773 --> 03:12.817
which they display and trade
他们展示和交易的

03:12.901 --> 03:15.361
at monthly sock-trading
conventions called
在每月的袜子交易中
称为的约定

03:15.445 --> 03:16.696
"Sock-N-Garten."
“袜子花园”。

03:16.779 --> 03:19.157
Sock-N-Garten.
袜子花园。

03:19.240 --> 03:20.700
Wow.
哇。

03:20.783 --> 03:22.702
Squidward, do you think
Vikings really
章鱼哥，你觉得
维京人真的

03:22.785 --> 03:26.247
drink their beverages
in Viking size?
喝他们的饮料
维京尺寸？

03:26.331 --> 03:28.082
Of course they do.
当然有。

03:28.166 --> 03:29.542
How else would Mr. Krabs
不然蟹老板怎么会呢？

03:29.626 --> 03:33.546
come up with such
a brilliant idea?
想出这样的
一个绝妙的主意？

03:33.630 --> 03:35.006
Do you
think that...
你呢
认为...

03:35.089 --> 03:38.551
Can't you see
I am trying to work?
你看不到吗
我正在努力工作吗？

03:38.635 --> 03:40.136
But...
但...

03:40.219 --> 03:41.846
There's so much more about
Vikings that I wanna find out.
还有很多关于
我想知道维京人。

03:41.930 --> 03:45.183
Well, then, why
don't you go ask them?
那么，为什么
你不去问问他们吗？

03:46.768 --> 03:48.895
Thanks, Squidward,
mwah!
谢谢，章鱼哥，
哇！

03:51.481 --> 03:53.316
"Dear Vikings.
“亲爱的维京人。

03:53.399 --> 03:54.734
I am writing to ask you guys
我写信是想问你们

03:54.817 --> 03:59.197
about your lives and stuff.
关于你的生活和事情。

03:59.280 --> 04:01.324
If you would take the time
如果你愿意花时间

04:01.407 --> 04:03.618
to answer all my neat questions
回答我所有巧妙的问题

04:03.701 --> 04:07.080
then that would be really swell.
那么那就真的膨胀了。

04:50.039 --> 04:51.624
Ah, Helga.
啊，赫尔加。

04:51.708 --> 04:53.918
Tell me once again
of the time you visited
再告诉我一次
您访问的时间

04:54.002 --> 04:57.088
those remote Himalayan
hot springs.
那些遥远的喜马拉雅山
温泉。

04:59.340 --> 05:00.967
Uhh... A letter.
呃……一封信。

05:01.050 --> 05:05.805
Why must you always come
in here during story time?
为什么你一定要来
讲故事的时候在这里？

05:05.888 --> 05:08.641
But, but I...
但是，但是我...

05:08.725 --> 05:11.644
Please, no,
you don't understand.
拜托，不，
你不明白。

05:11.728 --> 05:13.563
I was only
trying to...
我只是
试图...

05:13.646 --> 05:16.607
Ohh... Ah!
噢……啊！

05:16.691 --> 05:19.777
Your majesty,
look, a letter.
陛下，
看，一封信。

05:19.861 --> 05:22.488
How incredibly interesting.
多么有趣啊。

05:22.572 --> 05:24.449
I must read it at once.
我必须立即阅读它。

05:33.374 --> 05:35.168
Welcome to the Krusty Krab.
欢迎来到蟹堡王。

05:35.251 --> 05:37.211
May I take your order?
我可以接受您的订单吗？

05:37.295 --> 05:38.880
We're Vikings.
我们是维京人。

05:38.963 --> 05:42.341
Our chieftain sent us here
because... We got this letter.
我们的酋长派我们来这里
因为...我们收到了这封信。

05:42.425 --> 05:46.095
SpongeBob, there's some
Vikings here to see you.
海绵宝宝，有一些
维京人来这里见你。

05:46.179 --> 05:47.555
What's that Squidward,
I couldn't hear you.
那个章鱼哥是什么
我听不见你说话。

05:47.638 --> 05:49.849
I was- ohh...
我当时——哦...

05:49.932 --> 05:53.269
Ah, are you the one
they call the SpongeBob?
啊，你是那个吗
他们叫海绵宝宝？

05:53.352 --> 05:54.896
: I think so.
: 我想是的。

05:54.979 --> 05:59.067
Well, we are here to teach you
all about the Vikings.
好吧，我们是来教你的
关于维京人的一切。

05:59.150 --> 06:00.443
Huzzah!
好哇！

06:00.526 --> 06:04.906
One of the things Vikings
like to do is redecorate.
维京人的事情之一
喜欢做的就是重新装修。

06:11.788 --> 06:14.832
How interesting.
多么有趣啊。

06:14.916 --> 06:18.044
And another ting
we Vikings like to do is...
还有另一个叮
我们维京人喜欢做的是...

06:18.127 --> 06:19.670
Appropriate.
合适的。

06:21.798 --> 06:24.008
What a fascinating culture.
多么迷人的文化啊。

06:24.092 --> 06:27.303
And on occasion,
the Vikings...
有时，
维京人...

06:27.387 --> 06:29.555
We've been known to liberate.
我们以解放而闻名。

06:29.639 --> 06:32.725
What the... Hey,
you can't do that!
这是什么……嘿，
你不能那样做！

06:32.809 --> 06:35.937
I can't believe
how much I'm learning.
我不敢相信
我学到了多少。

06:37.688 --> 06:39.398
Squidward, I'll be
back in one hour.
章鱼哥，我会的
一小时后回来。

06:39.482 --> 06:41.400
I'm going on me lunch break.
我要去午休了

06:41.484 --> 06:43.236
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

06:46.114 --> 06:49.242
Would you mind telling us
what this is all about?
你介意告诉我们吗
这是怎么回事？

06:49.325 --> 06:50.618
Shush.
嘘。

06:50.701 --> 06:52.954
Now that you're part of our crew
现在您已成为我们团队的一员

06:53.037 --> 06:55.331
I guess we should
introduce ourselves.
我想我们应该
自我介绍一下。

06:55.414 --> 06:57.667
This is Olaf.
这是奥拉夫。

06:57.750 --> 06:59.627
And this is Olaf...
这是奥拉夫...

06:59.710 --> 07:01.420
And this is Olaf.
这是奥拉夫。

07:01.504 --> 07:03.256
This is... Olaf.
这是……奥拉夫。

07:03.339 --> 07:06.259
...Olaf, Olaf, Olaf.
...奥拉夫，奥拉夫，奥拉夫。

07:06.342 --> 07:09.262
And, um... Um?
而且，嗯……嗯？

07:09.345 --> 07:10.429
Olaf.
奥拉夫。

07:10.513 --> 07:11.472
Olaf.
奥拉夫。

07:11.556 --> 07:12.640
So let me guess.
那么让我猜一下。

07:12.723 --> 07:14.559
Your name must be...
你的名字一定是...

07:14.642 --> 07:17.395
That's right, Gordon.
没错，戈登。

07:17.478 --> 07:18.771
Nice to meet ya.
很高兴认识你。

07:18.855 --> 07:22.233
Now before I put you two to work
现在在我让你们两个去工作之前

07:22.316 --> 07:24.277
I wanna know what...
我想知道什么...

07:24.360 --> 07:27.280
Wait, I still have
lots more questions about
the Vikings way of life.
等等，我还有
还有很多关于的问题
维京人的生活方式。

07:27.363 --> 07:28.698
Like what?
比如什么？

07:28.781 --> 07:30.366
Well, like...
嗯，就像...

07:30.449 --> 07:32.535
What do the Vikings
like to do for fun?
维京人做什么
喜欢做什么好玩的？

07:32.618 --> 07:35.538
Hmm... Fun.
嗯...有趣。

07:35.621 --> 07:39.167
Hm, um, um,
um, uh-well...
嗯嗯嗯
嗯，呃，好吧……

07:39.250 --> 07:40.626
What about
the shield toss?
怎么样
盾牌投掷？

07:40.710 --> 07:42.253
Oh, yeah, yeah-yeah.
哦，是啊，是啊，是啊。

07:47.383 --> 07:49.468
Hm, anything else?
嗯，还有什么吗？

07:49.552 --> 07:51.012
Um...
嗯...

07:51.095 --> 07:53.681
Ooh, what about
flaming  shield toss?
哦，那又怎么样
火焰盾投掷？

07:53.764 --> 07:55.850
Oh, yeah-yeah-yeah.
哦，是啊是啊。

08:04.609 --> 08:05.568
Anything else?
还要别的吗？

08:05.651 --> 08:07.320
All: Ehh...
全体：呃……

08:07.403 --> 08:08.529
: Ahh...
: 啊...

08:08.613 --> 08:10.489
I, I, I can't really
think of anything.
我我我真的不能
想什么。

08:10.573 --> 08:12.325
Me neither.
我也不。

08:12.408 --> 08:13.492
Oh, yah.
哦，是的。

08:13.576 --> 08:14.619
What is it, Olaf?
这是什么，奥拉夫？

08:14.702 --> 08:16.037
We like to sing songs.
我们喜欢唱歌。

08:16.120 --> 08:17.955
Ohh...
哦...

08:18.039 --> 08:19.332
Vikings: No, we don't.
维京人：不，我们不。

08:19.415 --> 08:21.459
Wait, no!
等等，不！

08:21.542 --> 08:23.836
OK, I admit it was a lousy idea.
好吧，我承认这是一个糟糕的主意。

08:23.920 --> 08:26.172
I promise it won't happen again.
我保证这种事不会再发生了。

08:26.255 --> 08:27.381
Ah!
啊!

08:27.465 --> 08:28.591
You got that right.
你说得对。

08:31.093 --> 08:33.137
: Dah-hoo-dee-hoo.
: 哒哒哒哒。

08:36.641 --> 08:38.517
Any other questions?
还有其他问题吗？

08:38.601 --> 08:40.228
I'll let you know
if I think of anything.
我会让你知道
如果我想到什么。

08:40.311 --> 08:43.981
So tell me, what is it that
you two know how to do?
那么告诉我，那是什么
你们两个知道怎么办吗？

08:44.065 --> 08:48.486
Well, Mr. Krabs
tells me I'm pretty good
with a spatula.
好吧，蟹老板
告诉我我很好
用抹刀。

08:48.569 --> 08:49.987
Ha.
哈。

08:50.071 --> 08:51.864
You're our ship's
new head chef.
你是我们的船
新任主厨。

08:51.948 --> 08:53.574
And what can you do?
你能做什么？

08:53.658 --> 08:55.701
Well, if you must know
好吧，如果你一定要知道的话

08:55.785 --> 08:58.246
I'm a widely renowned
clarinet virtuoso...
我是一个广为人知的
单簧管演奏家...

08:58.329 --> 09:00.373
state-recognized
interior design consultant.
国家认可的
室内设计顾问。

09:00.456 --> 09:04.043
Licensed and board certified
antique macrame connoisseur.
获得许可并获得董事会认证
古董花边鉴赏家。

09:04.126 --> 09:06.045
Born and raised collector
and sculptor of driftwood
天生的收藏家
和浮木雕塑家

09:06.128 --> 09:08.839
and able to recognize
over 1300 brand names
并且能够认出
超过1300个品牌

09:08.923 --> 09:12.551
of single-person pedal-operated
vehicles at a single glance.
单人踏板操作
车辆一目了然。

09:12.635 --> 09:15.554
Plus, I make
a killer souffle.
另外，我做
杀手蛋奶酥。

09:15.638 --> 09:17.181
Impressive.
感人的。

09:17.265 --> 09:19.767
You'll be the ship's
bathroom attendant.
你将成为这艘船的
浴室服务员。

09:19.850 --> 09:22.478
A promotion-
congratulations, Squidward.
促销活动——
恭喜你，章鱼哥。

09:24.814 --> 09:26.983
Hold it right
there, whiskers.
保持正确
那里，胡须。

09:27.066 --> 09:28.734
Let's not forget
you're the one
我们不要忘记
你就是那个

09:28.818 --> 09:31.153
who dragged me onto
this crate in the first place.
谁把我拖上了
首先是这个箱子。

09:31.237 --> 09:36.075
Now you ask me to pour
my heart out, and this is
the respect I get?
现在你要我倒
我心碎了，这就是
我得到的尊重？

09:36.158 --> 09:39.704
Well, you got another
thing coming, honey.
好吧，你还有另一个
事情即将发生，亲爱的。

09:39.787 --> 09:42.456
I want off this
boat pronto.
我想摆脱这个
船很快。

09:42.540 --> 09:45.584
