You mean to question
the will of the tribe?
你的意思是质疑
部落的意志？

10:00.391 --> 10:04.395
If it means saving
my best friend... Then, yes.
如果这意味着节省
我最好的朋友...那么，是的。

10:05.313 --> 10:07.356
Then... Pick up the weapon
然后……拿起武器

10:07.440 --> 10:10.359
and fight with me a duel in
