10:13.738 --> 10:15.781
Duel, duel...
决斗，决斗……

10:15.865 --> 10:17.950
Go on,
pick it up.
继续，
捡起来。

10:18.034 --> 10:19.285
But...
但...

10:22.038 --> 10:23.873
Go on, weakling.
继续吧，弱者。

10:23.956 --> 10:26.751
Owned  .
拥有。

