这就是结局...

10:38.387 --> 10:40.264
The end of the Vikings.
维京人的终结。

10:42.350 --> 10:45.811
Oh, Valhalla,
why have you forsaken us?
哦，瓦尔哈拉，
你为什么抛弃我们？

10:45.895 --> 10:47.980
Guys, you just ran
