11:07.166 --> 11:10.169
What the barnacles
is going on down there?
什么是藤壶
下面有什么事吗？

11:10.252 --> 11:12.630
Dah!
呸！

11:12.713 --> 11:14.507
It's all yours.
都是你的了。

11:14.590 --> 11:16.425
Thanks.
谢谢。

11:21.847 --> 11:23.015
There.
那里。

11:23.099 --> 11:25.518
Look up there,
what's he doing?
抬头看那儿，
他在做什么？

11:25.601 --> 11:28.479
Here goes nothing.
这里什么也没有发生。

11:37.780 --> 11:39.532
Now that's what I Call
现在这就是我所说的

11:39.615 --> 11:42.243
a Viking size adventure.
维京规模的冒险。

11:57.049 --> 12:00.469
You'll never escape
this time, Man Ray.
你永远无法逃脱
这次是曼·雷。

12:00.553 --> 12:02.388
Our molecular bubble
我们的分子气泡

