12:09.437 --> 12:11.272
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

12:13.566 --> 12:15.234
Stop!
停止！

12:17.778 --> 12:19.155
Thanks for making this easy.
感谢您让这一切变得简单。

12:19.238 --> 12:20.448
Till next time...
直到下次...

12:22.575 --> 12:24.743
Announcer: You just enjoyed
another exciting episode
播音员：你刚刚享受了
