12:45.931 --> 12:47.349
Doors open at 8:00 A.M.
上午 8:00 开门

12:47.433 --> 12:48.767
Oh, boy!
哦，孩子！

12:48.851 --> 12:50.436
We're gonna get our books
and then we're gonna
我们要去拿我们的书
然后我们要

12:50.519 --> 12:52.521
meet Mermaid Man
and Barnacle Boy.
遇见人鱼男
和藤壶男孩。

12:52.605 --> 12:53.898
Then we're gonna
shake their hands
然后我们要
握手

12:53.981 --> 12:55.608
and then they're
gonna sign our books!
