13:13.209 --> 13:14.543
I couldn't.
我不能。

13:14.627 --> 13:17.213
Besides that would be lying,
and lying is wrong.
除此之外就是说谎，
说谎是错误的。

13:17.296 --> 13:20.174
OK, hmm...
好吧，嗯……

13:20.257 --> 13:21.467
Oh, oh-oh, I know.
哦，哦，哦，我知道。

13:21.550 --> 13:24.637
Um, what are those things
