14:27.866 --> 14:30.411
I'll really have to  go.
我真的得走了。

14:33.247 --> 14:36.584
Can anyone tell me what the hand
signal is for a left turn?
谁能告诉我手是什么
信号灯是左转吗？

14:36.667 --> 14:38.752
Ohh...
哦...

14:40.045 --> 14:42.798
Something the matter, SpongeBob?
有什么事吗，海绵宝宝？

14:42.881 --> 14:46.719
Yes... A little, ooh, ooh.
是的……有一点，哦哦。

14:46.802 --> 14:49.305
I gotta... gotta go to the...
我得...得去...

14:49.388 --> 14:51.473
I'd say so- here.
我会这么说——在这里。

14:51.557 --> 14:53.142
SpongeBob: The bathroom key.
海绵宝宝：浴室钥匙。

14:53.225 --> 14:56.645
And make sure you return
this bathroom key to  my  desk
并确保您返回
这间浴室是我办公桌的钥匙

14:56.729 --> 14:59.857
or you're in
big trouble, mister.
或者你在
大麻烦了，先生。

