就这样吧。

15:39.021 --> 15:40.356
Thank you!
谢谢你！

15:40.439 --> 15:42.107
Mm, anytime, boys.
嗯，任何时候，孩子们。

15:42.191 --> 15:45.194
And remember,
stay on the path
