你们可以自由走了。

16:39.623 --> 16:42.167
Ice cream!
冰淇淋！

16:42.251 --> 16:45.379
Oh, come on, I don't
have time for this.
哦，来吧，我不
有时间做这个。

16:45.462 --> 16:47.881
Yeah, four scoops.
是的，四勺。

16:47.965 --> 16:49.967
Patrick, have you
forgotten, I gotta go.
帕特里克，有你吗
