From now on you
can come back
从现在开始你
可以回来

17:02.646 --> 17:04.982
and have all
the free ice cream
you want.
并拥有所有
免费冰淇淋
你想要的。

17:05.065 --> 17:06.567
: Bah...
: 呸...

17:21.957 --> 17:24.710
Well, this certainly
has been a glorious day.
嗯，这当然
这是美好的一天。

17:24.793 --> 17:25.794
But I better get
back to class.
但我最好得到
回到课堂。

17:28.213 --> 17:30.132
:
You said it, buddy.
：
