18:30.234 --> 18:32.152
:
SpongeBob, SpongeBob...
：
海绵宝宝，海绵宝宝……

18:32.236 --> 18:35.614
SpongeBob, SpongeBob,
SpongeBob...
海绵宝宝，海绵宝宝，
海绵宝宝...

18:35.697 --> 18:36.782
SpongeBob, SpongeBob...
海绵宝宝，海绵宝宝……

18:36.865 --> 18:38.200
SpongeBob, SpongeBob...
海绵宝宝，海绵宝宝……

18:38.283 --> 18:40.661
SpongeBob, SpongeBob...
海绵宝宝，海绵宝宝……

18:40.744 --> 18:41.954
Ohh...
哦...

18:42.037 --> 18:44.581
Whoa...
