18:57.761 --> 18:59.179
Well, if it's for the fans
好吧，如果是为了粉丝的话

18:59.263 --> 19:00.681
I guess I could play
just one game more.
我想我可以玩
只剩下一场比赛了。

19:00.764 --> 19:02.099
Man: Not today, yellow.
男：今天不行，黄种人。

19:02.182 --> 19:03.809
You're playing with
