19:03.892 --> 19:06.144
And we know he's violated
his parole somehow.
我们知道他被侵犯了
他的假释不知何故。

19:06.228 --> 19:07.813
You might as well
confess, Dale.
你也可以
承认吧，戴尔。

19:07.896 --> 19:10.065
Dale: Hey, man,
I haven't done nothing.
戴尔：嘿，伙计，
我什么也没做。

19:10.148 --> 19:12.234
Oh, yeah- what have
you got in there?
哦，是的-有什么
你进去了吗？

19:12.317 --> 19:15.112
Hm, quasi-gummy
chewy candy fish.
嗯，准软糖
耐嚼的糖果鱼。

19:15.195 --> 19:17.155
Is this how you have fun?
这就是你玩得开心的方式吗？

19:17.239 --> 19:19.658
By eating your own kind?
吃自己的同类？

19:19.741 --> 19:22.703
Scum like you make me sick.
像你这样的人渣让我恶心。

19:22.786 --> 19:23.829
Cuff him.
铐住他。

19:26.081 --> 19:28.250
it's a shame
what happened to Dale.
真遗憾
戴尔发生了什么事。

19:28.333 --> 19:30.043
We were classmates
back in boating school.
我们曾经是同学
回到划船学校。

19:30.127 --> 19:32.004
He was a good student
他是个好学生

19:32.087 --> 19:34.173
until he started
cutting class.
直到他开始
缺课。

19:34.256 --> 19:36.008
Ever since then, he's lived
从那时起，他就生活在

19:36.091 --> 19:38.844
the lonely life of a criminal.
罪犯的孤独生活。

19:38.927 --> 19:40.846
Eh, eh, guh, guh...
呃呃呃呃呃……

19:40.929 --> 19:42.222
Criminal?
刑事？

19:42.306 --> 19:43.891
I gotta get back to class.
我得回去上课了

19:45.100 --> 19:46.810
I can't be a ditcher.
我不能当一个弃子

20:01.950 --> 20:03.452
Bye!
再见！

20:09.124 --> 20:11.043
Ow- almost there.
噢——快到了。

20:11.126 --> 20:13.879
Just have to get past the...
只需要熬过这关...

20:13.962 --> 20:16.590
"Bikini Bottom Hug Fest"?
“比基尼拥抱节”？

20:17.382 --> 20:19.676
Aw, does someone need a hug?
哦，有人需要拥抱吗？

20:19.760 --> 20:22.304
No, no, nah-nah-nah,
not now, please.
不，不，不，不，不，
现在不行，拜托。

20:22.387 --> 20:24.306
Don't fight the love, kid.
别与爱抗争，孩子。

20:24.389 --> 20:26.183
Miss, if you don't
let me go right now
小姐，如果你不
让我现在就走

20:26.266 --> 20:28.101
I'm gonna have to turn
into a criminal.
我将不得不转身
变成一个罪犯。

20:28.185 --> 20:29.394
Wha!
世界卫生大会！

20:29.478 --> 20:31.605
That sounded
like a threat.
那听起来
就像威胁一样。

20:31.688 --> 20:33.899
I am so sorry.
我很抱歉。

20:37.611 --> 20:40.781
Whoa!
哇！

20:40.864 --> 20:42.115
The tar pits?
焦油坑？

20:42.199 --> 20:44.910
Oh, I'm sinking, I'm...
哦，我要沉下去了，我……

20:47.412 --> 20:49.247
I guess this
is the end, SquarePants.
我猜这个
结束了，方裤。

20:49.331 --> 20:50.958
But like the old saying goes:
但正如那句老话所说：

20:51.041 --> 20:54.378
"Better to end up sinking into
a prehistoric lake Of tar
“最好最终陷入
史前焦油湖

20:54.461 --> 20:57.381
than to turn to
a life of crime."
而不是转向
犯罪的一生。”

20:57.464 --> 21:00.300
Good-bye, world,
good-bye, Mrs. Puff.
再见，世界，
再见，普芙夫人。

21:00.384 --> 21:01.969
I'll always cherish
those last kind words
我会永远珍惜
最后那些善意的话

21:02.052 --> 21:04.429
that you said to me.
你对我说的。

21:04.513 --> 21:08.350
"Make sure you return that
bathroom key to my desk
“确保你归还了
我书桌的浴室钥匙

21:08.433 --> 21:11.687
or you're
in big trouble mister."
或者你是
先生遇到大麻烦了。”

21:23.323 --> 21:27.119
Oh, I never returned
Mrs. Puff's bathroom key.
哦，我再也没有回来
普夫夫人的浴室钥匙。

21:27.202 --> 21:28.704
I can't give up now.
我现在不能放弃。

21:30.956 --> 21:33.875
: SpongeBob,
SpongeBob, SpongeBob...
：海绵宝宝，
海绵宝宝，海绵宝宝……

21:45.053 --> 21:46.513
I made it.
我做到了。

21:46.596 --> 21:48.849
And a minute before
the final bell.
而一分钟前
最后的钟声。

21:48.932 --> 21:50.225
I am home free.
我有空回家了。

21:52.227 --> 21:55.230
Mrs. Puff, I'm really sorry.
帕芙女士，真的很抱歉。

21:55.313 --> 21:56.982
Please forgive me.
请原谅我。

21:57.065 --> 21:58.191
I don't know what happened.
我不知道发生了什么事。

21:58.275 --> 22:00.027
Everything just
got away from me.
一切都只是
离开了我。

22:00.110 --> 22:03.572
: I brought back
your bathroom key, though.
: 我带回来了
不过，你的浴室钥匙。

22:03.655 --> 22:07.993
I haven't the foggiest idea
what you're carrying
on about, SpongeBob.
我没有最模糊的想法
你携带的东西
关于海绵宝宝。

22:08.076 --> 22:09.786
But I don't have time for it.
但我没有时间。

22:09.870 --> 22:11.663
I've got my own problems.
我有我自己的问题。

22:11.747 --> 22:16.168
Johnny law finally caught up
to me for ditchin' jury duty.
约翰尼·洛终于追上了
我放弃了陪审团职责。

22:16.251 --> 22:18.170
Let this be
a lesson to you, son.
让这成为
儿子，给你一个教训。

22:20.047 --> 22:21.673
Never ditch.
永远不要抛弃。

22:21.757 --> 22:25.260
OK, Mrs. Puff,
I'll never ditch again.
好的，普芙女士，
我再也不会放弃了

22:25.343 --> 22:27.179
That's a good boy, SpongeBob.
这是一个好孩子，海绵宝宝。

22:27.262 --> 22:29.347
Good... Again?
很好……再来一次？

22:29.431 --> 22:31.308
What do you mean "again"?!
“又”是什么意思？！

“又”是什么意思？！